# One sample at a time, deliberately.
#
# crypt.zip's three x64 samples each complete Stage 1 on roughly one attempt in
# ten, and everything worth measuring (arming, the Stalker window, the OEP) only
# happens after that. Spreading a fixed CI budget over three samples buys a third
# of the completions of concentrating it on one -- so this manifest carries the
# primary executable alone. Widen back to tests/samples-crypt.list once this one
# reaches the OEP and produces a dump.
#
# LABEL<TAB>SOURCE<TAB>NOTES
ngahost	samples/dl/NgaHost.exe	winlicense x64 + flexlm (single-target manifest)
